 *
 * Platform administrators need to update configuration key/value/description for live system changes, emergency overrides, or maintenance. This test ensures that all updatable values (param_value & description) are properly changed on update, and the system returns the correct, fully-updated configuration. (Note: param_name uniqueness checks cannot be tested on update as param_name is immutable in update request).
 *
 * Workflow:
 * 1. Create a new configuration (to ensure an existing, updateable record).
 * 2. Prepare new param_value and description to update all editable fields.
 * 3. Use PUT /aiShop/configurations/{id} to update param_value and description.
 * 4. Validate returned result matches the new values and has the same config id.
 */
export async function test_api_aiShop_configurations_test_update_configuration_with_valid_data(
